<title>Document</title></head><body><div id="ie84b139fbab84e84a4c4c7081227a399_1"></div><div style="min-height:36pt;width:100%"><div><font><br></font></div></div><div style="text-align:right"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Exhibit 99.1</font></div><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#160;</font></div><div style="text-align:center"><img alt="ubntlogo_jpga.jpg" src="ubntlogo_jpga.jpg" style="height:77px;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:77px"></div><div><font><br></font></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">UBIQUITI INC. REPORTS SECOND QUARTER FISCAL 2026 FINANCIAL RESULTS</font></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">&#126; Record Revenues of $814.9 million, up 35.8% YoY &#126;</font></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">&#126; GAAP Diluted Earnings Per Share of $3.86 &#126;</font></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:center"><font><br></font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">New York, NY - February&#160;6, 2026 - Ubiquiti Inc. (NYSE&#58; UI) (&#34;Ubiquiti&#34; or the &#34;Company&#34;) today announced its financial results for the second quarter ended December&#160;31, 2025.</font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font><br></font></div><div style="margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Second Quarter Fiscal 2026 Financial Summary</font></div><div style="padding-left:4.68pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-9pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">&#8226;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5.15pt">Revenues of $814.9 million</font></div><div style="padding-left:4.68pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-9pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5.5pt">GAAP diluted EPS of $3.86</font></div><div style="padding-left:4.68pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-9pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5.5pt">Non-GAAP diluted EPS of $3.88</font></div><div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:9pt"><font><br></font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Additional Financial Highlight</font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-left:4.68pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-9pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5.5pt">The Company's Board of Directors declared a $0.80 per share cash dividend payable on February&#160;23, 2026 to shareholders of record at the close of business on February&#160;17, 2026.</font></div><div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:9pt"><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-left:0.18pt;text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Financial Highlights ($, in millions, except per share data)</font></div><div style="margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:12pt;padding-left:0.18pt;text-align:justify"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.861%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:52.168%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.495%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:13.781%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.495%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:13.781%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.495%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:13.785%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Income statement highlights</font></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">F2Q26</font></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">F1Q26</font></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt